{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女團S.H.E成員陳嘉樺（Ella）日前在鄭州舉行第40場巡唱，有粉絲為慶祝她巡演一周年，親手縫製蛋糕造型旳布藝擺件，繡滿巡演各站的城市名，甚有心思。</p><p>Ella在台上收到這份賀禮時，愛不釋手不停拍照，又指這份禮物「掟不爛」，隨後用力狂揈蛋</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.384025+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T16:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"3fdbbbc55b32ddb538d155204bb190b61c273f2b49efc94aa4cf482607e75856","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}